996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/34c7a7fed3ce8e1d46fcd926c3f1e566.mp4?t=1758156996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face formidable enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles aren\u2019t limited to waves of units, you\u2019ll also confront bosses with unique abilities. Prepare for duels that will test both your army and your tactical reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/8607e524ff59290c91290d7356b28281.poster.avif?t=1758156996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/8607e524ff59290c91290d7356b28281.webm?t=1758156996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/8607e524ff59290c91290d7356b28281.mp4?t=1758156996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unpredictable conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new twist: bonuses for the player, advantages for the enemy, shared effects, or even environmental hazards like tiles that rise and damage any unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/98ae6212c0ed743067aa6c93a4c07b3c.poster.avif?t=1758156996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020660/extras/98ae6212c0ed743067aa6c93a4c07b3c.webm?t=1758156996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka